# Database migrations

- Do not edit applied migration files; add a new migration instead.
- Prefer the project migration command: `{{CMD_MIGRATE}}`
- Ask before destructive or irreversible schema changes.
- Keep migration names clear and one concern per migration.
- See boundaries in @AGENTS.md
